    "answer": {
      "short": "$0$",
      "worked": "Opposite angles are supplementary, so $C=\\pi-A$ and $D=\\pi-B$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos A+\\cos B+\\cos C+\\cos D&=\\cos A+\\cos B+\\cos(\\pi-A)+\\cos(\\pi-B)\\\\\\cos A+\\cos B+\\cos C+\\cos D&=\\cos A+\\cos B-\\cos A-\\cos B\\\\\\cos A+\\cos B+\\cos C+\\cos D&=0.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 32
